@startuml Linkwise_Propagation_Evidence_Flow
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #16324F
  BackgroundColor #EFF5F8
  FontColor #16324F
}

cloud "Configured sources\nNOAA / NASA / VOACAP /\nPSKReporter / GIRO / RMS" as SOURCES
component "Source adapters\npoll, validate, deduplicate" as ADAPTER
database "Collection runs\nprovider status / coverage" as RUNS
component "Normalizer and\nfreshness / quality checks" as NORMALIZER
database "Evidence store\ntyped, immutable records" as EVIDENCE
component "Path analysis service\nversioned deterministic runs" as ANALYSIS
database "Analysis snapshots\nexact input IDs / roles / versions" as SNAPSHOTS
component "Candidate builder and ranker\neligibility + utility + explanation" as RANK
database "Ranking snapshot\ncandidate links + ranking entries" as CANDIDATES
component "MCP tools / resources" as MCP
component "AI planner" as AI
component "Link manager and\ndeterministic policy" as POLICY
component "Radio / modem / Winlink\nadapters and session controller" as SESSION
database "Decision history\nselect / wait / no-route" as DECISIONS
database "Session attempts + events\nmeasured outcomes" as HISTORY

SOURCES --> ADAPTER : external observations / forecasts
ADAPTER --> NORMALIZER : timestamped records
ADAPTER --> RUNS : per-provider status / timing
NORMALIZER --> EVIDENCE : typed immutable observations
RUNS --> EVIDENCE : collection provenance
EVIDENCE --> ANALYSIS : exact immutable input set
ANALYSIS --> SNAPSHOTS : analysis + model/config version
SNAPSHOTS --> RANK : path estimates
EVIDENCE --> RANK : operational evidence / RMS inventory
HISTORY --> RANK : measured station outcomes
RANK --> CANDIDATES : ranked eligible links
CANDIDATES --> MCP : queryable snapshot
MCP <--> AI : tools / resources
AI --> MCP : select / wait / no-route request
MCP --> POLICY : typed application command
POLICY --> SESSION : revalidate, prepare, authorize
POLICY --> DECISIONS : policy evaluation + decision
DECISIONS --> SESSION : optional selected candidate
SESSION --> HISTORY : one attempt per try; ordered events
HISTORY --> EVIDENCE : measured outcomes as typed records

note bottom of MCP
  MCP serves bounded requests and exposes stable run, evidence,
  analysis, ranking, decision, and aggregate IDs. Scheduled collection
  and analysis continue independently of model polling.
end note
note bottom of POLICY
  Forecasts and rankings inform choice but never grant
  transmit authority or bypass local interlocks.
end note
@enduml
